# My settings (personal, not committed)

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` at the repository root and add `CLAUDE.local.md` to `.gitignore`.
Claude Code loads it after `CLAUDE.md`. It can add strictness and preferences; it cannot relax any rule above it.

## My role

Add one import line for your role on its own line below, written without backticks, for example
`@.ai-governance/roles/developer.md`. One role per person; if you work in two, import both and the stricter
rule wins where they differ. Roles: `developer`, `qa-tester`, `architect`, `security`, `it-operations`,
`business-analyst`, `project-manager`, `data-analyst`, `general-staff` (files in `.ai-governance/roles/`).

